## Directory Structure Standards

```md
includes/
├── Services/                    # Business logic services
│   ├── ServiceInterface.php    # Service marker interface
│   ├── ExampleService.php      # Individual services
│   └── DebugLog/               # Feature-specific services
├── API/                        # REST controllers only
│   ├── RestController.php      # Base controller
│   └── ExampleController.php   # Individual controllers
├── Providers/                  # Service providers
│   └── AppServiceProvider.php  # Service registration
└── Core/
    ├── ServiceResponse.php     # Response wrapper
    └── Container/              # Container system

src/
├── pages/[feature-name]/       # Feature pages
│   ├── index.tsx              # Main component
│   ├── types.ts               # TypeScript types
│   ├── hooks.ts               # Custom hooks
│   └── components/            # Feature components
│       ├── feature-viewer.tsx # Display component
│       └── feature-controls.tsx # Controls component
└── components/ui/             # Reusable UI components
```

